hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"162","[AI-translation] Jab koi apne musalman bhai ki beemari mein ayadat kare to baithne tak jannat ke bagh mein chale; baithe to rahmat use dhaanp le. Subah jaae to sham tak sattar hazar farishte us ke liye salat padhte hain; sham ko jaae to subah tak sattar hazar farishte us ke liye salat padhte hain. [Ayadat ki fazeelat]"
